# Supabase

- Treat Row Level Security (RLS) as mandatory for user-facing tables; policies must match product rules, not allow-all for dev.
- Use the server-side Supabase client (service role or cookie-based user session) for privileged work; keep anon key usage client-side and RLS-backed.
- Prefer SQL migrations for schema changes; keep generated types in sync when the repo uses them.
